{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國手工藝品電商平台Etsy當地時間周四表示，將不再允許商家在其平台上銷售由人工智能（AI）生成的食譜和手工圖樣。此舉是該公司為規範平台上人工智能使用而採取的更廣泛舉措之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583510.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.917680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:26:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"b1815efe8cc630b0fd46b48cb2ef7a948b3446190752e48ba99d90d064784fdf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}